#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1023
msgid "- Linear (rotate → move straight → rotate)"
msgstr "- 线性（旋转 → 直线移动 → 旋转）"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1022
msgid "- S-Curve (smooth Bézier path, curvature clamped)"
msgstr "- S 曲线（平滑贝塞尔路径，曲率受限）"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1017
msgid "1) Animate chassis with keyframes (location + rotation)."
msgstr "1) 使用关键帧为底盘制作动画（位置 + 旋转）。"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1019
msgid "2) Run Validate Motion to check feasibility in physical world (no sideways slip)."
msgstr "2) 运行验证运动以检查在物理世界中是否可行（无侧向滑动）。"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1021
msgid "3) If desired, Autocorrect:"
msgstr "3) 如有需要，自动校正："

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1025
msgid "4) Pick Speed Profile (Constant, Ease Whole Timeline, or Ease Per Segment)."
msgstr "4) 选择速度曲线（恒定、整条时间线缓动或逐段缓动）。"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1030
msgid "5) Build Cache → Attach Drivers (or Bake Wheels) to drive wheel spin."
msgstr "5) 构建缓存 → 附加驱动器（或烘焙车轮）以驱动车轮旋转。"

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1035
msgid "6) Export results:"
msgstr "6) 导出结果："

#: true_roboanimator/__init__.py:1033
msgid "Also visually check if correct wheel was calculated for turns, if wheels are swapped, please use swap wheel checkbox."
msgstr "另请目视检查转向时计算的车轮是否正确；如果车轮互换，请使用交换车轮复选框。"

